1
00:00:00,018 --> 00:00:01,617
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,619 --> 00:00:02,999
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,223 --> 00:00:05,630
(Episode 64)

4
00:00:10,418 --> 00:00:11,418
What's this?

5
00:00:13,071 --> 00:00:14,145
Mom.

6
00:00:16,029 --> 00:00:17,029
Mom.

7
00:00:19,525 --> 00:00:20,525
Mom!

8
00:00:22,612 --> 00:00:23,612
Mom!

9
00:00:24,489 --> 00:00:25,489
What are you doing?

10
00:00:28,191 --> 00:00:29,191
Mom!

11
00:00:30,462 --> 00:00:31,462
Get your hands off the door!

12
00:00:33,658 --> 00:00:36,358
Mom, I'm sorry. I was wrong.

13
00:00:36,705 --> 00:00:39,045
I'll just see him today,
then I'll stay home from now on.

14
00:00:39,445 --> 00:00:42,105
I'm supposed to meet Ji Hu today.
We made plans!

15
00:00:42,505 --> 00:00:44,592
He's the one who asked to see me.

16
00:00:44,639 --> 00:00:45,900
I'm sorry.

17
00:00:46,732 --> 00:00:48,401
The fact that you're suffering
like this...

18
00:00:48,792 --> 00:00:50,085
it's all my fault.

19
00:00:50,519 --> 00:00:51,656
No, Mom.

20
00:00:52,051 --> 00:00:54,006
I'm not going to blame you anymore.

21
00:00:54,585 --> 00:00:57,243
Just let me see him today. Okay?

22
00:00:57,357 --> 00:00:59,205
- Mom!
- Ji Hu is out of the question!

23
00:00:59,258 --> 00:01:01,192
Not even if the world falls apart.

24
00:01:01,285 --> 00:01:02,999
Stay single for the rest of your life!

25
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,974
- Mom!
- Find someone else!

26
00:01:06,065 --> 00:01:07,816
Tell them I'm dead and date someone else!

27
00:01:07,832 --> 00:01:11,125
They won't humiliate you this much
if you say your parents died young.

28
00:01:11,172 --> 00:01:12,300
No, go study abroad!

29
00:01:12,498 --> 00:01:16,158
I'll scrape together whatever money I can,
even if I have to beg, so go study abroad!

30
00:01:18,411 --> 00:01:21,002
Don't you dare let her out.

31
00:01:21,004 --> 00:01:22,199
I'm begging you.

32
00:01:23,045 --> 00:01:25,496
It's for Ji Ni's sake, understand?

33
00:01:27,451 --> 00:01:28,662
Mom.

34
00:01:30,572 --> 00:01:31,732
Mom!

35
00:01:32,675 --> 00:01:35,139
Mom!

36
00:01:44,265 --> 00:01:46,697
Mom!

37
00:01:48,657 --> 00:01:50,322
Is anyone there?

38
00:01:51,808 --> 00:01:53,166
Mom!

39
00:02:24,058 --> 00:02:25,922
Ji Hu, it's me. Na Ji Ni.

40
00:02:26,512 --> 00:02:27,980
You really don't know who I am?

41
00:02:28,587 --> 00:02:29,587
Please?

42
00:02:31,378 --> 00:02:33,018
You even gave me this necklace.

43
00:02:56,585 --> 00:02:58,029
What am I going to do?

44
00:03:08,618 --> 00:03:11,484
Please, just open the door!

45
00:03:15,691 --> 00:03:18,610
Mom!

46
00:04:05,958 --> 00:04:07,870
What were you to me?

47
00:04:08,044 --> 00:04:09,693
I was told we were coworkers.

48
00:04:10,327 --> 00:04:12,033
We were more than coworkers.

49
00:04:12,412 --> 00:04:13,412
We were...

50
00:04:13,767 --> 00:04:15,960
each other's reason to keep living.

51
00:04:16,559 --> 00:04:18,332
That's how you described us.

52
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:19,840
Me?

53
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:21,490
And what about you?

54
00:04:23,718 --> 00:04:26,730
I couldn't express my feelings properly...

55
00:04:28,619 --> 00:04:29,619
I'm sorry.

56
00:04:30,292 --> 00:04:33,120
I've finally decided to love you back.

57
00:04:33,208 --> 00:04:34,534
I'm sorry I'm so late.

58
00:04:36,087 --> 00:04:37,680
I see.

59
00:04:38,731 --> 00:04:40,376
Anyway, let's meet tomorrow and talk more.

60
00:04:41,592 --> 00:04:42,592
Okay.

61
00:04:42,778 --> 00:04:44,991
I'll see you tomorrow, for sure.

62
00:05:04,778 --> 00:05:06,022
Please.

63
00:05:07,348 --> 00:05:09,245
Please open the door!

64
00:05:09,978 --> 00:05:12,268
Just this once, Mom! Okay?

65
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,034
Just once!

66
00:05:49,972 --> 00:05:52,301
Why come here
instead of staying at the office?

67
00:05:52,965 --> 00:05:54,805
I work better at cafes.

68
00:05:54,807 --> 00:05:57,250
Maybe I'm just used to
not having an office.

69
00:05:58,369 --> 00:05:59,549
And the coffee's good too.

70
00:05:59,625 --> 00:06:00,931
I prefer working from home.

71
00:06:01,291 --> 00:06:02,371
You saw the file I sent, right?

72
00:06:02,373 --> 00:06:03,820
Yeah, I'm looking at it now.

73
00:06:05,359 --> 00:06:06,359
Here you go.

74
00:06:08,212 --> 00:06:09,888
Director, it's been a while.

75
00:06:09,890 --> 00:06:11,001
Have you been well?

76
00:06:11,754 --> 00:06:12,985
What's Ji Ni doing?

77
00:06:13,032 --> 00:06:14,361
She's not answering her phone.

78
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,823
What?

79
00:06:18,158 --> 00:06:20,097
She said she'd meet Ji Hu today.

80
00:06:21,158 --> 00:06:23,804
Did Ji Hu's mom stop her again? Or Do Hee?

81
00:06:24,044 --> 00:06:25,729
Her mom stopped her.

82
00:06:26,170 --> 00:06:27,295
She's locked in the house.

83
00:06:27,625 --> 00:06:29,649
Her phone's confiscated.
She can't go anywhere.

84
00:06:29,651 --> 00:06:31,805
She even nailed her door shut.

85
00:06:36,652 --> 00:06:38,855
Today's such an important day.

86
00:06:39,912 --> 00:06:41,348
Last night, Ji Ni said...

87
00:06:41,529 --> 00:06:43,600
she felt like she'd gone
from rock bottom to paradise.

88
00:06:44,154 --> 00:06:45,540
She was so happy.

89
00:06:46,347 --> 00:06:47,498
Her mom's being too cruel.

90
00:06:47,605 --> 00:06:50,305
She came home yesterday
with a swollen cheek from being slapped.

91
00:06:50,678 --> 00:06:52,967
- That's why she nailed the door shut.
- Really?

92
00:06:53,378 --> 00:06:55,377
She was hit? By Ji Hu's mom?

93
00:06:56,409 --> 00:06:57,578
What do we do?

94
00:07:02,565 --> 00:07:05,702
Director, could you fill in
until our part-timer arrives?

95
00:07:06,912 --> 00:07:08,335
Jung A!

96
00:07:12,185 --> 00:07:13,954
Didn't you say...

97
00:07:14,051 --> 00:07:16,029
your brother scolded you for meddling?

98
00:07:16,416 --> 00:07:18,214
I can't help it this time.

99
00:07:19,709 --> 00:07:20,709
Good luck.

100
00:07:21,018 --> 00:07:22,645
Where are you going?
You said we'd have a meeting.

101
00:07:23,092 --> 00:07:26,198
Call me after your shift, handsome.

102
00:07:28,792 --> 00:07:30,325
Should we film "Coffee Prince?"

103
00:07:30,385 --> 00:07:33,765
Or "Earl Grey Princess?"

104
00:08:15,945 --> 00:08:18,443
The person you are calling is unavailable.
Please leave a message...

105
00:08:18,445 --> 00:08:20,205
The woman who claimed to be
my birth mother...

106
00:08:20,722 --> 00:08:22,043
never came.

107
00:08:23,798 --> 00:08:26,475
I never got to hear her say...

108
00:08:27,121 --> 00:08:28,490
that I hadn't really been abandoned.

109
00:08:41,558 --> 00:08:43,814
Looking into Ji Ni's desperate eyes,

110
00:08:44,272 --> 00:08:46,140
I wanted to find some hope.

111
00:08:49,358 --> 00:08:51,117
In my life, promises always...

112
00:08:51,674 --> 00:08:52,879
end up shattered like this.

113
00:09:03,091 --> 00:09:06,067
- Register the marriage?
- Once your name is on the papers,

114
00:09:06,379 --> 00:09:08,692
Ji Ni will back off for good.

115
00:09:09,025 --> 00:09:11,005
She wouldn't want
to be the mistress, would she?

116
00:09:11,212 --> 00:09:12,939
It'd be awful for her.

117
00:09:14,391 --> 00:09:17,840
Even if Ji Hu regains his memory,
we'll be safe.

118
00:09:18,554 --> 00:09:19,700
Okay.

119
00:09:20,405 --> 00:09:22,148
But will his dad agree?

120
00:09:22,478 --> 00:09:24,571
He told me yesterday
to put an end to all this.

121
00:09:24,572 --> 00:09:26,131
That man, seriously...

122
00:09:26,878 --> 00:09:28,897
Looks like your dad finally
got through to him.

123
00:09:30,585 --> 00:09:33,637
Anyway, leave your dad to handle that.

124
00:09:33,768 --> 00:09:35,411
You hurry up and arrange the wedding.

125
00:09:35,465 --> 00:09:38,679
Okay, Mom. I'll try.

126
00:09:41,665 --> 00:09:42,665
You're here?

127
00:09:43,524 --> 00:09:45,321
Ji Hu!

128
00:09:45,624 --> 00:09:47,893
Where were you? I've been waiting.

129
00:09:49,357 --> 00:09:50,357
Waiting for me?

130
00:09:51,712 --> 00:09:53,221
You're always the one waiting for me.

131
00:09:53,222 --> 00:09:56,196
Of course. Who else do I have but you?

132
00:09:56,923 --> 00:09:57,923
Ji Hu.

133
00:09:58,338 --> 00:10:02,583
I've made lots of mistakes
and I'm hot-tempered, but I'll do better.

134
00:10:03,252 --> 00:10:05,248
Please put in a good word for me
with your dad.

135
00:10:06,311 --> 00:10:07,924
But where were you, really?

136
00:10:08,025 --> 00:10:09,565
I searched every floor of the hospital.

137
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:11,324
The rooftop garden.

138
00:10:11,852 --> 00:10:14,011
I was supposed to meet Ji Ni,
but she never came.

139
00:10:14,112 --> 00:10:15,835
You were going to meet Ji Ni?

140
00:10:16,569 --> 00:10:17,569
Behind my back?

141
00:10:18,352 --> 00:10:20,598
I wanted to hear more
about why she was crying.

142
00:10:22,214 --> 00:10:23,214
I'm tired.

143
00:10:23,623 --> 00:10:25,205
- I'll lie down for a bit.
- Okay.

144
00:10:27,465 --> 00:10:28,465
Ji Hu.

145
00:10:29,019 --> 00:10:31,890
If you see her again,
don't believe a word she says.

146
00:10:32,401 --> 00:10:34,998
- Why?
- Her mom was someone's mistress.

147
00:10:35,092 --> 00:10:36,562
That's why your mom dislikes her.

148
00:10:36,672 --> 00:10:38,882
- That's not her fault.
- There you go again.

149
00:10:39,432 --> 00:10:41,717
Only decent parents raise decent kids.

150
00:10:42,551 --> 00:10:45,470
You keep giving Na Ji Ni the wrong idea
by acting like this.

151
00:10:45,472 --> 00:10:46,868
How close were you two...

152
00:10:47,145 --> 00:10:50,336
for people to call her your girlfriend
instead of me?

153
00:10:52,898 --> 00:10:55,053
I'm sorry. It won't happen again.

154
00:10:55,355 --> 00:10:56,506
Really?

155
00:11:09,552 --> 00:11:11,024
Then let's get married.

156
00:11:11,505 --> 00:11:13,625
- Let's register our marriage first.
- What?

157
00:11:13,805 --> 00:11:16,480
I was afraid of losing you.
That's why the accident happened.

158
00:11:17,178 --> 00:11:18,492
Show me I can trust you.

159
00:11:18,572 --> 00:11:20,911
Will you trust me
if we register our marriage?

160
00:11:21,291 --> 00:11:23,305
- Then no more fighting?
- Of course.

161
00:11:23,712 --> 00:11:25,102
I'll trust you with all my heart.

162
00:11:25,984 --> 00:11:28,466
I won't doubt you.
I'll let you live in peace.

163
00:11:30,546 --> 00:11:33,369
Ji Hu! Don't laugh.

164
00:11:36,472 --> 00:11:37,630
Hey, what's with you?

165
00:11:38,251 --> 00:11:41,072
So this is what time travel is like.

166
00:11:41,132 --> 00:11:42,805
You've gone right back to the past.

167
00:11:44,085 --> 00:11:46,820
Im Ji Hu, don't you remember me?

168
00:11:47,315 --> 00:11:48,413
Who are you?

169
00:11:49,065 --> 00:11:52,909
- Did I know her?
- No, Ji Hu. You don't know her.

170
00:11:53,074 --> 00:11:54,845
Get out!

171
00:11:55,351 --> 00:11:57,765
Did you forget how you got drunk
and cried in my arms?

172
00:11:58,645 --> 00:11:59,918
Did you really do that?

173
00:12:00,665 --> 00:12:03,017
That's not all. Want to hear more?

174
00:12:03,425 --> 00:12:05,485
Things got pretty steamy between us.

175
00:12:08,012 --> 00:12:10,550
You can't even remember
the person who really matters,

176
00:12:10,604 --> 00:12:12,617
but you're here with this bitch?

177
00:12:13,012 --> 00:12:14,159
Aren't you scared?

178
00:12:14,698 --> 00:12:17,684
If you're going to let her lead you,
at least know where she's taking you!

179
00:12:17,925 --> 00:12:19,708
Ji Hu, don't listen to her.

180
00:12:21,145 --> 00:12:23,556
You didn't lose your memory.
You became an idiot.

181
00:12:23,558 --> 00:12:25,090
Watch what you say.

182
00:12:25,598 --> 00:12:27,245
I was going to talk to Na Ji Ni.

183
00:12:27,278 --> 00:12:28,791
She's the one who didn't show up.

184
00:12:28,865 --> 00:12:31,638
Ji Ni's being kept at home.

185
00:12:31,992 --> 00:12:33,699
Your mom hit her yesterday.

186
00:12:34,355 --> 00:12:35,488
Ji Hu.

187
00:12:35,962 --> 00:12:37,908
I mean this.

188
00:12:38,413 --> 00:12:40,539
Don't take any action
until you remember everything.

189
00:12:40,965 --> 00:12:42,421
Don't just take her word for it.

190
00:12:43,902 --> 00:12:45,218
Please. I'm begging you.

191
00:12:51,252 --> 00:12:52,453
Who is she?

192
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:55,064
Na Ji Ni's friend.

193
00:12:55,172 --> 00:12:56,455
More like her servant.

194
00:12:56,965 --> 00:12:58,064
Don't mind her.

195
00:13:23,631 --> 00:13:25,642
You said you wanted to talk.

196
00:13:28,692 --> 00:13:31,683
I thought we had a good connection, Se Ri.

197
00:13:32,316 --> 00:13:33,686
I'm sorry it came to this, too.

198
00:13:33,758 --> 00:13:34,989
After my husband died,

199
00:13:35,260 --> 00:13:38,490
I thought we could be good friends.

200
00:13:39,905 --> 00:13:42,806
I'm sorry I was so harsh
in front of your wife.

201
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:45,654
I have nothing against you, Joong Bin,

202
00:13:46,537 --> 00:13:50,111
but seeing my daughter's face
made me lose control.

203
00:13:50,712 --> 00:13:52,529
I understand. That's how it is
when someone hits your child.

204
00:13:53,008 --> 00:13:54,376
I'm sorry on my wife's behalf.

205
00:13:54,485 --> 00:13:56,470
She had no right to hit her.

206
00:13:56,658 --> 00:13:58,245
Please, say what you came to say.

207
00:13:59,578 --> 00:14:00,704
Did Ji Hu...

208
00:14:01,478 --> 00:14:03,172
really like Ji Ni?

209
00:14:03,278 --> 00:14:04,419
As far as I know,

210
00:14:04,895 --> 00:14:07,305
Ji Ni rejected Ji Hu more than once.

211
00:14:07,611 --> 00:14:09,121
Because of Do Hee...

212
00:14:09,714 --> 00:14:10,817
and because of me.

213
00:14:12,012 --> 00:14:14,908
My daughter and I are used to this.

214
00:14:17,192 --> 00:14:20,911
But I think the accident
made Ji Ni change her mind.

215
00:14:21,738 --> 00:14:24,300
While Ji Hu was in the hospital,

216
00:14:24,914 --> 00:14:28,267
Ji Ni couldn't eat or sleep.
All she did was pray.

217
00:14:28,772 --> 00:14:30,196
You need to know this.

218
00:14:30,805 --> 00:14:33,586
She was born carrying the shame
of what I did,

219
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:35,856
but she has the kindest heart.

220
00:14:36,385 --> 00:14:37,385
I see.

221
00:14:38,378 --> 00:14:40,346
I'm keeping her in her room even now.

222
00:14:40,712 --> 00:14:43,208
Please get Ji Hu and Do Hee married soon.

223
00:14:43,578 --> 00:14:45,396
I'll help Ji Ni through it.

224
00:14:45,952 --> 00:14:47,692
She'll give up when he gets married.

225
00:14:47,725 --> 00:14:49,267
That would be difficult.

226
00:14:49,518 --> 00:14:51,608
I don't approve of Do Hee either.

227
00:14:52,838 --> 00:14:54,376
You're a good judge of character.

228
00:14:55,431 --> 00:14:58,439
But your wife seems determined
to have him marry Do Hee.

229
00:15:00,218 --> 00:15:01,797
Anyway, that's none of my business.

230
00:15:02,631 --> 00:15:04,630
Please keep Ji Hu under control.

231
00:15:04,691 --> 00:15:07,347
I'll do the same with Ji Ni.

232
00:15:07,931 --> 00:15:09,869
Was there anything else?

233
00:15:46,145 --> 00:15:47,203
Yes.

234
00:15:48,041 --> 00:15:50,048
I've applied. Thank you.

235
00:15:51,471 --> 00:15:52,898
I'll call you after the interview.

236
00:15:55,085 --> 00:15:56,748
If it works out, dinner's on me.

237
00:15:57,692 --> 00:15:59,506
An expensive dinner.

238
00:16:00,538 --> 00:16:01,538
Bye.

239
00:16:04,172 --> 00:16:06,787
- A job interview?
- For a district office job.

240
00:16:06,788 --> 00:16:08,238
A senior colleague referred me.

241
00:16:08,977 --> 00:16:11,684
Good. You should've done this sooner.

242
00:16:11,691 --> 00:16:13,491
That'll be a relief for Yeong Ju.

243
00:16:29,571 --> 00:16:30,651
Ji Ni!

244
00:16:32,609 --> 00:16:33,700
Are you sick?

245
00:16:33,898 --> 00:16:36,031
Why aren't you answering? Ji Ni!

246
00:16:38,079 --> 00:16:39,079
Ji Ni!

247
00:16:41,226 --> 00:16:42,226
Hey!

248
00:16:44,154 --> 00:16:46,106
Hey!

249
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:50,506
Ji Ni!

250
00:16:50,813 --> 00:16:52,985
Open the door!

251
00:16:53,074 --> 00:16:55,608
Ji Ni!

252
00:16:57,495 --> 00:16:59,899
Hey! I told you no!

253
00:17:00,045 --> 00:17:02,916
I just met with Ji Hu's dad!

254
00:17:03,957 --> 00:17:05,660
Hey! Ji Ni!

255
00:17:08,785 --> 00:17:10,510
Why are you calling me?

256
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:12,957
I'm sorry. I really am.

257
00:17:13,148 --> 00:17:15,520
There was a reason. I'll come over now.

258
00:17:17,429 --> 00:17:19,399
- You're all the same.
- What?

259
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:20,991
What do you mean?

260
00:17:21,691 --> 00:17:24,272
I'll explain everything.
You're in your room, right?

261
00:17:24,365 --> 00:17:25,631
I'm coming now.

262
00:17:26,118 --> 00:17:27,638
You couldn't come because of your mom?

263
00:17:30,405 --> 00:17:31,405
Yes.

264
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:34,518
It seems no one wants us to meet.

265
00:17:35,412 --> 00:17:36,575
There's no need to come.

266
00:17:38,045 --> 00:17:40,733
Ji Hu, please.

267
00:17:40,932 --> 00:17:42,437
Please don't contact me anymore.

268
00:17:43,065 --> 00:17:44,407
It upsets my fiancée.

269
00:18:16,485 --> 00:18:18,976
- Ji Ni!
- Just leave her alone!

270
00:18:18,978 --> 00:18:20,052
Leave her alone?

271
00:18:20,053 --> 00:18:23,855
How can I stand by and watch my daughter
walk straight into a nightmare?

272
00:18:24,429 --> 00:18:25,429
Please...

273
00:18:32,072 --> 00:18:35,396
You've destroyed my life twice, Mom.

274
00:18:35,912 --> 00:18:37,494
His family doesn't want you.

275
00:18:38,218 --> 00:18:41,685
Ji Hu's forgotten everything,
even his feelings for you.

276
00:18:41,765 --> 00:18:43,371
What are you trying to do?

277
00:18:44,325 --> 00:18:47,125
Are you going to offer yourself up
and let them tear you apart?

278
00:18:47,132 --> 00:18:50,656
If I'd seen him today,
his memories might've come back.

279
00:18:50,658 --> 00:18:51,998
Or they might not have.

280
00:18:53,151 --> 00:18:56,442
Even if he remembers,
his family will still reject you.

281
00:18:56,618 --> 00:18:59,499
I'd rather his memories never came back.

282
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:01,058
Are you wishing me bad luck?

283
00:19:02,151 --> 00:19:04,438
For the first time in my life,
I fell in love.

284
00:19:05,791 --> 00:19:07,665
After holding on for so long,

285
00:19:08,887 --> 00:19:10,934
my heart finally felt warm
for the first time,

286
00:19:13,792 --> 00:19:16,175
and I wanted to hold his hand.

287
00:19:18,098 --> 00:19:19,751
You ruined everything.

288
00:19:20,485 --> 00:19:24,371
You've been ruining my life
since the day I was born.

289
00:19:25,099 --> 00:19:26,718
- Na Ji Ni.
- That's right!

290
00:19:27,331 --> 00:19:28,959
Na Ji Ni, Na Se Ri's daughter!

291
00:19:29,092 --> 00:19:31,985
A mistress's daughter, a child of sin.
I know it all too well!

292
00:19:34,965 --> 00:19:36,895
I'll never forgive you for today.

293
00:19:38,258 --> 00:19:39,792
You're the worst, Mom.

294
00:19:41,258 --> 00:19:42,672
Think about Yeong Ju.

295
00:19:46,798 --> 00:19:48,595
How long do you think you can hide...

296
00:19:48,597 --> 00:19:50,633
your relationship with her?

297
00:19:51,518 --> 00:19:54,535
Imagine that future mother-in-law
finding out about the three of us.

298
00:19:54,792 --> 00:19:57,031
Isn't the thought of it absurd?

299
00:19:58,572 --> 00:20:00,686
Ji Hu would've protected me.

300
00:20:01,801 --> 00:20:03,358
You fool.

301
00:20:04,472 --> 00:20:07,857
Of all people,
why did you have to fall for him?

302
00:20:08,205 --> 00:20:11,632
Give me one good reason
I should support this relationship!

303
00:20:13,845 --> 00:20:15,166
You can relax now.

304
00:20:16,006 --> 00:20:18,214
I won't be seeing him again.

305
00:20:32,945 --> 00:20:34,202
You'll hurt your hand. Stop!

306
00:20:34,404 --> 00:20:36,216
- Let go!
- Ji Ni!

307
00:20:37,290 --> 00:20:38,731
- Let go!
- Ji Ni!

308
00:20:44,118 --> 00:20:45,147
Do you have a bandage?

309
00:21:11,838 --> 00:21:14,436
- Yes, Tae O.
- Ji Ni, are you okay?

310
00:21:14,945 --> 00:21:16,302
Jung A told me what happened.

311
00:21:18,015 --> 00:21:19,451
I'm not okay.

312
00:21:20,516 --> 00:21:21,863
Everything's ruined.

313
00:21:22,918 --> 00:21:24,635
It's over, Tae O.

314
00:21:26,378 --> 00:21:28,578
I'm so upset.

315
00:21:29,352 --> 00:21:31,122
Stop crying
and go grab Ji Hu by the collar.

316
00:21:31,525 --> 00:21:33,733
Tell him, "I'm the one you love."

317
00:21:34,002 --> 00:21:35,002
"How can you not remember me?"

318
00:21:36,065 --> 00:21:38,021
That's what I was going to do,

319
00:21:39,392 --> 00:21:40,980
but I couldn't.

320
00:21:42,743 --> 00:21:44,442
It's all over.

321
00:21:45,301 --> 00:21:46,470
Okay, cry.

322
00:21:46,732 --> 00:21:47,922
Let it all out.

323
00:21:52,375 --> 00:21:53,719
I'm sorry.

324
00:22:53,505 --> 00:22:54,902
What did you want to talk about?

325
00:22:56,732 --> 00:22:59,403
Didn't Joong Bin say
this was the end of the road?

326
00:22:59,436 --> 00:23:01,268
Yes, he did,

327
00:23:01,741 --> 00:23:03,563
but Ji Hu keeps asking for me.

328
00:23:03,565 --> 00:23:05,518
Just because he lost his memory...

329
00:23:06,030 --> 00:23:08,038
doesn't mean everyone else is blind.

330
00:23:09,552 --> 00:23:11,555
Ji Ni's the woman he likes.

331
00:23:11,978 --> 00:23:13,527
I know that, and so does Yeong Ju.

332
00:23:14,275 --> 00:23:17,245
- So?
- You're taking this chance, aren't you?

333
00:23:18,058 --> 00:23:21,163
Stop lying to him
and manipulating his memories.

334
00:23:21,165 --> 00:23:23,474
He only believes me.

335
00:23:23,865 --> 00:23:25,188
No matter what his family says,

336
00:23:25,309 --> 00:23:27,511
- he won't listen.
- We'll handle that...

337
00:23:28,452 --> 00:23:29,607
ourselves.

338
00:23:30,736 --> 00:23:33,209
Right. No secret stays hidden forever.

339
00:23:33,725 --> 00:23:37,300
Soon, everyone will find out
that your wife is Ji Ni's dad's...

340
00:23:37,499 --> 00:23:38,604
official wife.

341
00:23:39,771 --> 00:23:40,771
What?

342
00:23:41,062 --> 00:23:43,414
- What did you say?
- You told me not to lie, right?

343
00:23:43,862 --> 00:23:45,007
Then I should tell the truth.

344
00:23:46,038 --> 00:23:47,215
How do you know that?

345
00:23:49,958 --> 00:23:53,138
Director Cha Seung Woo said
Ji Ni is his younger sister.

346
00:23:55,238 --> 00:23:57,118
Your wife is really something.

347
00:23:57,325 --> 00:23:59,758
I thought Ji Ni
was some kind of relative of hers.

348
00:24:00,472 --> 00:24:02,972
This family is such a mess, right?

349
00:24:05,018 --> 00:24:06,182
Uncle,

350
00:24:07,009 --> 00:24:08,431
please help me.

351
00:24:09,518 --> 00:24:11,703
Ji Hu's all I have.

352
00:24:12,598 --> 00:24:15,560
My love for him isn't a lie.
Not even a little.

353
00:24:15,832 --> 00:24:17,476
Why are you threatening me like this?

354
00:24:18,018 --> 00:24:19,598
We both have secrets.

355
00:24:20,845 --> 00:24:21,988
Don't we?

356
00:24:22,870 --> 00:24:24,607
Can I tell them?

357
00:24:26,508 --> 00:24:27,631
You little...

358
00:24:28,525 --> 00:24:31,486
I'm terrible at keeping secrets.

359
00:24:32,438 --> 00:24:35,487
Just give me a little push,
and it'll all come spilling out.

360
00:24:49,272 --> 00:24:51,210
How did it go? Did you meet with her?

361
00:24:52,245 --> 00:24:54,594
- I tried to ditch her, but it backfired.
- What?

362
00:24:54,765 --> 00:24:57,092
Seung Woo told her
Ji Ni was his younger sister.

363
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:58,160
Really?

364
00:24:58,211 --> 00:25:01,590
When Ji Ni tried to expose
Do Hee for faking her illness.

365
00:25:03,871 --> 00:25:05,276
What do we do now?

366
00:25:05,871 --> 00:25:06,871
But...

367
00:25:07,370 --> 00:25:10,178
I really think we need to stop Ji Hu.

368
00:25:11,125 --> 00:25:12,656
She's so awful.

369
00:25:13,337 --> 00:25:15,893
She's a real villain. A devil.

370
00:25:38,218 --> 00:25:41,203
Why are you in such a hurry?
What's the rush?

371
00:25:41,612 --> 00:25:43,000
The hospital bed is uncomfortable.

372
00:25:43,632 --> 00:25:46,334
Besides, we need to start
planning the wedding.

373
00:25:47,660 --> 00:25:48,692
The wedding?

374
00:25:49,018 --> 00:25:50,211
What are you talking about?

375
00:25:50,645 --> 00:25:52,482
We've decided to get married sooner.

376
00:25:52,852 --> 00:25:55,458
Uncle, Aunt,
you'll congratulate us, right?

377
00:25:56,658 --> 00:25:58,918
Didn't you say you'd decide
once you'd recovered more?

378
00:25:58,965 --> 00:26:01,347
We were going to get married anyway.
We're just moving things up.

379
00:26:01,758 --> 00:26:04,230
My mom keeps insisting we visit soon.

380
00:26:04,232 --> 00:26:05,740
She says she wants to see Ji Hu.

381
00:26:06,232 --> 00:26:08,272
I thought you said
you weren't going to England.

382
00:26:08,312 --> 00:26:10,105
She says she has
the perfect job for Ji Hu.

383
00:26:10,611 --> 00:26:13,371
We'll check it out, and if it looks good,
we'll stay for a while...

384
00:26:13,645 --> 00:26:15,995
- until he gets his memory back.
- Really?

385
00:26:16,458 --> 00:26:18,957
I hope the job your mom has in mind
is a good one.

386
00:26:19,032 --> 00:26:20,335
Of course.

387
00:26:21,144 --> 00:26:24,038
Okay. Let's discuss it
when your dad gets here.

388
00:26:24,092 --> 00:26:25,375
He should be here soon.

389
00:26:25,757 --> 00:26:26,757
Okay.

390
00:26:33,118 --> 00:26:34,218
Ji Ni.

391
00:26:36,027 --> 00:26:37,671
Ji Ni, you need to eat something.

392
00:26:43,512 --> 00:26:46,009
Ji Ni.

393
00:26:47,137 --> 00:26:49,164
Ji Ni!

394
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:50,520
Ji Ni!

395
00:26:51,115 --> 00:26:53,531
Seung Woo! Ji Ni collapsed!

396
00:26:55,257 --> 00:26:57,785
What? What are you talking about?

397
00:26:57,984 --> 00:27:00,005
Ji Ni!

398
00:27:03,098 --> 00:27:04,367
What's going on?

399
00:27:04,650 --> 00:27:07,229
What happened? Ji Ni!

400
00:27:16,418 --> 00:27:17,418
Ji Ni!

401
00:27:19,598 --> 00:27:21,553
- Mom!
- What's wrong? What happened?

402
00:27:21,554 --> 00:27:23,925
- Ji Ni collapsed.
- What? Why?

403
00:27:24,363 --> 00:27:26,498
I'll call you.

404
00:27:29,332 --> 00:27:30,491
What happened?

405
00:27:30,525 --> 00:27:31,825
Why is your son carrying her?

406
00:27:38,598 --> 00:27:41,418
Her son is Na Ji Ni's older brother.

407
00:27:43,219 --> 00:27:44,219
Her brother?

408
00:27:46,832 --> 00:27:47,832
Yeong Ju?

409
00:28:24,032 --> 00:28:27,450
(Family Register)

410
00:28:27,451 --> 00:28:29,050
You should've kept it a secret.

411
00:28:29,052 --> 00:28:31,812
I even went on about killing Na Se Ri.
What am I supposed to say now?

412
00:28:31,813 --> 00:28:34,674
You're letting your husband's mistress
and her daughter live with your sons.

413
00:28:34,676 --> 00:28:37,226
How was I supposed to know
you'd stoop that low?

414
00:28:37,228 --> 00:28:38,443
We can't blame them.

415
00:28:38,445 --> 00:28:40,705
- We must look strange to outsiders.
- Are you really going to England?

416
00:28:40,706 --> 00:28:43,010
You said you wanted to get married
and start a family soon.

417
00:28:43,012 --> 00:28:44,165
Don't go to England.

418
00:28:44,167 --> 00:28:45,290
Why are you doing this to me?

419
00:28:45,291 --> 00:28:47,425
You're treating Ji Hu like an idiot!

420
00:28:49,225 --> 00:28:51,225
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
